OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who waited nine days for
OL,4,Amiscarriage assessment 'fighting
OL,5,Aagainst system'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman who received an apology from
OL,8,FJohn Swinney over failures in her
OL,9,Fmaternity care has said she was
OL,10,F"fighting a system that wasn't working
OL,11,Ffor me at all".
OL,13,FElizabeth Crammond suffered a third
OL,14,Fmiscarriage in three years in March.
OL,15,FAfter experiencing pain and bleeding,
OL,16,Fshe waited nine days to see NHS medics,
OL,17,Fwho confirmed she had miscarried.
OL,19,FCrammond spoke at Holyrood, where she
OL,20,Fpresented a petition signed by more
OL,21,Fthan 900 people, calling for
OL,22,Fimprovements to maternity care.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
